<div#main.container>

    <p> Carnap is named for the philosopher, Rudolf Carnap (1891 – 1970).

    <blockquote.blockquote>
        <p> _{MsgInfopageCarnapQuote1}
        <p> _{MsgInfopageCarnapQuote2}
        <footer.blockquote-footer>Rudolf Carnap,
            <cite title="Empiricism Semantics and Ontology"> _{MsgInfopageCarnapQuoteSource}

    <p>
        Carnap is a free and open-source Haskell framework for creating and exploring formal languages, logics, and semantics. Carnap: Mississippi State is a version of #
        <a href="https://carnap.io/about">carnap.io
        \. The source files are in this #
        <a href="https://github.com/GRGSCT/Carnap-MSU">GitHub repository
        \.
